sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: API Authentication Sequence
    accDescr: Client authenticates with server using token exchange

    participant C as Client
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant R as Resource API

    C->>A: POST /auth/token (credentials)
    A-->>C: 200 OK (access_token, refresh_token)
    C->>R: GET /resource (Authorization: Bearer token)
    R->>A: Validate token
    A-->>R: Token valid
    R-->>C: 200 OK (resource data)
